      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 AAGL. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Deep endometriosis presenting with ascites and preserved fertility is an unusual combination. This report describes a unique case of deep endometriosis and primary infertility, with a successful pregnancy after an optimal surgical approach and personalized ovarian stimulation protocol for in vitro fertilization, which shows the importance of a multidisciplinary approach in these patients."
      },
